%% Recon exception workflow
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> OPEN : mismatch / unmatched / failed-pending
  OPEN --> ASSIGNED : supervisor or auto-assign
  ASSIGNED --> PENDING_APPROVAL : analyst proposes resolution
  PENDING_APPROVAL --> ASSIGNED : checker sends back
  PENDING_APPROVAL --> RESOLVED : checker ≠ resolver, step-up MFA
  RESOLVED --> REOPENED : underlying data changed (new group version)
  REOPENED --> ASSIGNED
  RESOLVED --> [*]
